take small kind of dog or pony movies.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:52.080 --> 00:03:58.480
Those kind of movies aren't right for&nbsp;
festivals. Horror films in general&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:59.520 --> 00:04:03.280
of a certain level don't there's a horror&nbsp;
audience out there that doesn't really&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:03.280 --> 00:04:09.520
require kind of lift of a film festival to&nbsp;
to get it out there and to a certain degree&nbsp;&nbsp;

